@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+---
+id: dl-002-represent-root-removal-as-json-null
+type: decision-log
+title: "Represent root removal as JSON null"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+RFC 6902 defines removal at a target location but does not prescribe a separate non-JSON sentinel
+for removal of the document root. This library promises a resulting JSON value.
+
+## Decision
+
+Treat `remove` at the empty JSON Pointer (the document root) as producing `null`.
+
+## Consequences
+
+The function always returns a JSON value, including for root removal. Moving the root into a child
+location remains invalid because the source location is a proper prefix of the destination.
