+---
+id: task-002-implement-rfc-6902-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `applyPatch` in `src/index.ts` with all six RFC 6902 operations and RFC 6901 pointer
+escaping and array-index validation. The implementation validates JSON inputs, clones the document
+before applying operations, and throws for invalid or unsuccessful operations.
+
+Added deterministic tests for every operation, root and escaped pointers, independent copy values,
+input immutability, and invalid-patch failures. Updated the README with the public API.
